OL,3,ABallon d'Or ceremony raises case of
OL,4,AFrench sports journalist jailed in
OL,5,AAlgeria
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe plight of French sports journalist
OL,8,FChristophe Gleizes, who is serving a
OL,9,Fseven-year prison sentence in Algeria,
OL,10,Fwas highlighted at the Ballon d'Or
OL,11,Fceremony.
OL,13,FRun by France Football magazine, the
OL,14,Fprestigious football awards were held
OL,15,Fin London where presenters Kate Scott
OL,16,Fand Thierry Henry dedicated the
OL,17,Foccasion to the 37-year-old reporter.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
