OL,3,ABallon d'Or ceremony raises case of
OL,4,AFrench sports journalist jailed in
OL,5,AAlgeria
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn a large screen behind them, it
OL,8,Fstated that he had been in jail for one
OL,9,Fyear, three months and 27 days and
OL,10,Falongside his photo was the hashtag
OL,11,F"#FreeGleize".
OL,13,FHe was arrested on a trip to Algeria
OL,14,Fwhere he had gone to report on a
OL,15,Ffootball club in Kabylie, a region
OL,16,Fwhere some people want
OL,17,Fself-determination. The authorities
OL,18,Faccused him of supporting terrorism.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
